Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate television.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,It gives me headaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.65,0:00:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，there's so many magnetic waves traveling in the airspace
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,because of TV and television，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,we're losing ten times as many brain cells as we're supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The cow says blank.」 Three letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dude！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Dude.」 I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magnetic waves，brain cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.63,0:00:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't understand the connection between all that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what else I heard？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magnetic waves shrink silicone molecules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！Turn it off！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's not working！- It's backwards！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do we do？- I don't know！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank God。I can't afford to get any smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish I had your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.66,0:01:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish I had your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I wish I had your… - Shaved pussy？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody's getting Snowball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。That thing's kind of scary，anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know something even scarier。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.47,0:01:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you heard about this videotape？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.89,0:01:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one where they do it on the boat？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then in the car？And then in the bathtub？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.18,0:01:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he's，like，「Hey，baby，I love you.」 And she's，like，「Where are we？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And did you see the… - No。Not that tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one with all the scary images.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，after you watch the tape，the phone rings，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.07,0:02:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,and this really scary voice comes on and says you're gonna die in，like…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seven days。Yeah，I saw that one with Josh last weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were with Josh last weekend？Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,My God！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes，I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ho！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know it！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is really weird。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Big house，only one phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you，my precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi，Mom。- Hi，precious。Having fun？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，we're just about to go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I guess a woman would know how to touch a…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Katie？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,God！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom，did you hear…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.55,0:05:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dogs are acting strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sue！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here？We were worried sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder what they're trying to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now，Washington，D.C.'s leading morning news program，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Morning News.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning。I'm Ross Giggins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,For our top story，we turn now to Cindy Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a developing story in Middleburg at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,A mysterious crop circle appeared in local farmer，Tom Logan's cornfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Elaborate prank or extraterrestrial phenomenon？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll update you as soon as we have any further information，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,but，either way，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's clear something strange is happening in that small town。Ross？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，I wasn't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coming up，more news after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cindy，you got a second？- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to take a look at this for that big strip- club expos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'd rather stick with the crop circle story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。You know those things are just a hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm telling you，I sense something about that cornfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call it women's intuition or ESPN or both，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I can tell when danger's near。I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My eyes！- Cindy，it's sweeps month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ratings mean everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,People want human- interest stories，like the one you did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,The report on breast augmentation？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was just ten minutes of topless women.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are these so interesting？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,For God's sake！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:07:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,People don't care about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,They want hard- hitting stories and in- depth coverage and… And…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,And twins！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think it was the Kreisel boys who cut that stuff into your corn？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,All I know is my crops are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bank's gonna foreclose if I can't pay the rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got 60 days to come up with $1.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。The last thing you needed was more…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,…hardship in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.31,0:08:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Especially after what happened to your…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sheriff，I don't need your sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to upset you，Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。I'm not a minister anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I lost my faith that terrible night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your faith will return，just as sure as the sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like a long shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，there's always an explanation for all this so- called phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was probably just the Kreisels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when I get through with them，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I doubt you'll be seeing anything strange on this farm for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right，Tom？Get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,George！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you back here tomorrow night after you pick up Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,That tractor needs fixing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，dawg。I can't help you。I have to get ready for my show.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not that stupid hip- hop stuff again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn it，George，when are you gonna do something with your life？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I got a dream！- What is your dream？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,To have a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:10:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,George，all you've done is chase adolescent fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I wanna be an astronaut，a cowboy，gynecologist to the stars.」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now，this stupid hip- hop thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,For your information，this hip-hop thing is gonna get me paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win that rap battle tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rap battle？For God's sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just hate me 'cause I'm black.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have any faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have any faith in anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,So why don't you just worry about you，and I'll worry about…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're late again，Aunt Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。I was stuck in traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.14,0:10:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cindy！- Brenda，hi！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's great to see you！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's been so long。- Too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I've had to spend more and more time at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,The news just keeps coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was the assignment？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draw your family and friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，anyone new in your life，Cindy？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you know，I just haven't found the right guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm looking for something more than just good sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，you want commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I want great sex。And when I meet that guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want a guy that's gonna hit that thing hard，like…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then flip you over and come at you from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,D- O- double- G.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did I say stop drawing？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then he'll look at you，like he gonna cut you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda，you're so romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，when I meet Mr。Right，I'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uncle George！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，sweetie，come here！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:11:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go get your stuff，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you。You're Tom Logan's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And you're that reporter，Cindy Campbell。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You did the story on our cop cycles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crop circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，you're here to pick up your…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nephew。Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't dress like a farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,My brother's the farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the rapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,For real。And here's the 6- 1- 1 on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's phone repair。You mean 4- 1- 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，I'll be doing the rap battle at the 23 Club tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Word。You two should come down！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I be rappin'，I be cappin'，I be tappin'，I be flappin'，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.67,0:12:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I be happening。Ding，bing，wing。Yo！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sounds good。- Would，could，should，'hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gug，mug，dug，bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we say we'll come，will you shut your ass up？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:13:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，then。Fresh。I'll see you guys tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.27,0:13:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。Bye。- Peace out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，who the fuck did that？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey，what is it？Are you having one of your visions？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a girl with black hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,She wants to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your period starts in three，two，one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,What else？Cody，what else do you see？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see a little boy and a grown woman，but no father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cody。- I see you kneeling in dog shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody，don't you understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as we have each other，that's all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody，I know things have been tough for you since your mom died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,God，I've been so selfish。Always putting my career first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,From now on，I'm gonna be thinking about you 24…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，Cindy！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey，I'm gonna be leaving soon，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know who she is？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,but sometimes she talks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's coming tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Father Muldoon！- Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful you could come。I've called all over for babysitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mind filling in now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is little Cody？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。He must be back in his room，playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，make sure Cody washes everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Also，he has a little rash on his behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you rub this lotion on his little bottom？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just apply it liberally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Father。Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，yeah。It's getting thick up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look，before we get on with the battles tonight，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a couple announcements to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.61,0:15:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know y'all are gonna wanna bust a cap in the air for your favorite rapper，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,but if you could please hold on to your gunfire until the end of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，look，let's just put the safeties on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's on the left side of the gun above the trigger guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will somebody get his ass out of here？Get his ass up out of here！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.05,0:16:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。DJ，spin that shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My bad。- Mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda，is something wrong？You look scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。All that stuff you was saying on TV，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just got a weird feeling something bad is heading my way，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,like when you see an Asian person behind the wheel of a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:16:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy，after the show，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,if I don't end up on all fours with some anonymous guy，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,or drink an ass load of Cristal
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,and have to sleep it off in a dumpster behind the Sizzler，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,you think maybe you could come back to my crib and hang out with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I will，Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pay my way，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，yo，yo，George！What's up with the man with the tightest rapping…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's up，B？What's good？- …on the streets，baby！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.62,0:17:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's good with you，boy？- Dude！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's good，baby？- Dude！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finally，the white man is gonna school the black man on how to rap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah！- Yeah，I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Word。- How many people are here，you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，man。100，200 whitey- hating，chrome- packing，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,ready to bust a cap in any white boy's ass who ain't bringing that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。At least。Yeah。- Word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong，George？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ever wonder when it's time to stop living up here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,and start living down here？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what if we stop living over here and move over there？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.65,0:17:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit，my Aunt ShaNeequa used to live over there，man，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:17:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- but that bitch got evicted，though。- Word？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:17:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，I'm dead serious。- What for？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mice。- Mice？I thought she had rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，man。Rats are outside，mice are inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，but what if a mouse goes outside？Does it become a rat？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if a rat is in the house，is it a mouse？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ain't never seen no mouse outside。That's what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's because it's a rat，fool！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn。Yeah，you might've just made a fact just now。That's some real shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fellas，what are you guys talking about？- That's hot！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，George，you need something？'Cause I will do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，about those chrome- packing，whitey- hating gangsters，perhaps…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What he need is a hype man。- Word！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，a- come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can be his Spliff Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's me，that's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my job，baby。That's what I do！You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I do。When you a hype man，you take them hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，let's get out there，man！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.03,0:18:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heads or tail，playboy，what's it gonna be？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You cannot escape your fate in the streets
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I count cash，you count sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better not sleep on the beats，capisce
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，all right，all right！That was hot！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about。That was hot，right？Right？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，what do we think？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.39,0:19:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you were both absolutely dreadful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ghastly。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'm doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,This club is totally pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it。You ready，George？It's show time，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- I just want to let you know，man，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.91,0:19:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,that no matter what goes on on that stage tonight，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,you'll always be in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's love。That's love right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I love you。- That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I love you，man。Can you feel it？- That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，come here，y'all。Come here。- Can you feel my love on your hip？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you feel it？- I can't get around！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- Come on，dawg！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.43,0:19:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's what I'm talking about。- You go out there and you rip it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，man？Do your thing tonight，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.69,0:19:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，cool。All right。- We shouldn't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:19:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We love each other。- I'm gonna go bring you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's do it，baby。We hyped！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，all right，all right。Y'all ready for the next throw down？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,To my left，we have the reigning champion，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,hailing from Fort Apache，the Bronx.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,BS 1-1-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some of y'all call him 「Jealous Ones Still Envy.」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some of y'all call him the Don Cartagena！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some of y'all call him Joey Crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stick 'em up！- But tonight，let's give it up for Fat Joe！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta go against him？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give it up！Give it up！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，you think they're here to see Fat Joe？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joe！Joe！Joe！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，man，they're saying，「Go！Go！Go！」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now our challenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a farmer rapper，so you know he been kicking the shit all day！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's give it up for my man，George！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about！Yeah，yeah！Come on，everybody！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's right。- Put your hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.37,0:20:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。Okay，Joey Crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You the reigning champion，so you get to spit first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，DJ，spin that shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,These guys can't be serious right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Standing Mini- Me，AKA 「I hope he ain't the one you fight with.」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，yo，this nigga's mad corny And he got no skills
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause he's all right But he's not real
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mean to hurt your feelings But you'll never get a deal
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.23,0:21:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause he's all right But he's not real
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.77,0:21:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a needle in the haystack I'm the don，the city slicker
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget cows and milk your mom's Her titties give ya that elixir
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thought he wasn't？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bet this nigga end up Having kids with his cousin
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Half- retarded My number- one fan be like
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,That means Fat Joe's the man！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a liar in denial
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.17,0:21:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill your ass quicker than I died in Empire
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,How dare you want to joust with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looking like you dying of SARS Or mad cow disease
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You fake D- rabbit out to battle me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eight miles down the road The farm's that- a- way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.85,0:21:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。No，no，wait a minute！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:22:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！All right！That was hot！That was tight，Fat Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo！Now，everybody，give it up for my man，George！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,DJ，spin that shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.08,0:22:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.01,0:22:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now everybody in the 2- 0- 2
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Throw your hands in the air 'Cause Fat Joe is through
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now everybody in the 2- 0- 2 Throw 'em up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check it out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a white boy But my neck is red
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I put Miracle Whip On my Wonder Bread
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.07,0:22:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,My face is pale I've never been in jail
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me and Buffy spend Every winter in Vail
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many bitches have I slapped？Zero
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.03,0:22:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Martha Stewart happens to be my hero
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I grew up on a farm And I was born with no rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。Phil's my uncle And I like to hang with him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't dance I wear khaki pants
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,My middle name's Lance My grandma's from France
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.51,0:23:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,So maybe I'm wack 'Cause my skin ain't black
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.13,0:23:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you can't talk smack 'Cause whitey just struck back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.31,0:23:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about，baby！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.48,0:23:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 2-0-2，Fat Joe is through！- 2-0-2，Fat Joe is through！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give it up for George！- Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.52,0:23:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my boy right there！That's what I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.48,0:23:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.91,0:23:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- George。George。The hood。- Hell，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lose the hood。- I know。We're in the 'hood now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，man。- He's a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys feeling me？In the 'hood？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.84,0:23:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.01,0:23:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，you can't give up rap just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:23:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rap- schmap！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.85,0:24:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，you still got it！See？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.73,0:24:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming over tonight，Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.90,0:24:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess I'm just going through a rough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.69,0:24:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda，you want to tell me what's really bothering you？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.61,0:24:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there's something I need to… I saw a tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.53,0:24:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you should know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.62,0:24:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It had these really shocking images，Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.58,0:24:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda，it was Mardi Gras.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never drank vodka before，and I was out of beads！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.46,0:24:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not that tape，Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I guess it's just an urban legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You watch it，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,and as soon as it's over，your phone rings and a creepy voice says，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.01,0:24:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,「You're gonna die in seven days.」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.02,0:24:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,And seven days later…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.10,0:24:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,When did you watch it？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.56,0:24:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,A week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.48,0:24:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A week ago tonight。- Brenda…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:24:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.28,0:25:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.62,0:25:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda！Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God，you bitch！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.63,0:25:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ketchup！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.09,0:25:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should have seen the look on your face！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got me！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.22,0:25:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda？Brenda？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.93,0:25:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！Brenda！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.73,0:25:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can't believe you fell for that fake seizure！- But it seemed so real！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.16,0:25:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It did，didn't it？- And you peed！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.54,0:25:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！I really sold that shit，didn't I？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just love the look on your face when you are scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.33,0:25:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Girl，you are too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.80,0:26:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got you with the old fake hand！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.14,0:26:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Girl，you were scared！- Well，I know！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.93,0:26:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。I was just kidding。- Well，you've taken it too far，Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.90,0:26:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get the rest of the popcorn！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.53,0:26:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.66,0:26:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget it。I am not falling for it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.55,0:26:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy，the news is on！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.85,0:26:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another little white girl done fell down a well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.73,0:26:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifty black people get their ass beat by police today，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,but the whole world gotta stop for one little whitey down a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.11,0:27:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.70,0:27:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The TV's leaking！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.37,0:27:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.37,0:27:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy，something's wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.10,0:27:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy，this bitch is messing up my floor！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.48,0:27:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy，help me！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.23,0:27:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.40,0:27:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get up，you little ugly bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.95,0:27:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Let me see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you gonna do？That's all？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.08,0:27:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm whupping her ass，Cindy！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.96,0:27:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！What's up？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.22,0:28:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy，please help me！Cindy！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.94,0:28:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，hang on a second。Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.11,0:28:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Father Muldoon here。We're getting along famously.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.94,0:28:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks again，Father。Bye- bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.19,0:28:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.70,0:28:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.13,0:28:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，yes，of course I'll tell her。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.85,0:28:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sue's teacher，Brenda。She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.48,0:28:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'd better tell her。- No，no，no。I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.65,0:29:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sue？- Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.70,0:29:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know your teacher，Miss Brenda？- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.70,0:29:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's dead！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.95,0:29:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gone forever！Died a horrible，painful death！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.96,0:29:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gone，gone，gone，just like your dog！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.46,0:29:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dog's dead？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.71,0:29:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just ran him over with the car when I drove in！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.34,0:29:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone you love around you is dying！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.35,0:29:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't call me 「Father.」 I haven't been a clergyman since…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.36,0:29:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.40,0:29:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I hadn't fallen asleep while driving for that exact 20 minutes，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.87,0:29:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,if I hadn't drank that exact whole bottle of Jgermeister，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.45,0:30:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,if I hadn't raped and mutilated that exact mulatto hitchhiker…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.21,0:30:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sayaman… - …if I hadn't been caught in that
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.96,0:30:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,exact motel room with those exact two boys…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.71,0:30:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sayaman。I don't see what any of this has to do with Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.09,0:30:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。Those were other nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.85,0:30:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if it had been that night，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I might have missed her。That terrible night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.96,0:30:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's your wife，Father。She's hurt。- Annie？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.75,0:30:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was hit by a truck and she's pinned against a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.75,0:30:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.21,0:30:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as the truck has her pinned，she'll stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.26,0:30:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.10,0:31:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.10,0:31:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,She broke her wiener？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.36,0:31:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look what happens to the taco.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.53,0:31:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I don't understand all this fancy medical lingo。I wanna see Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.74,0:31:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's split in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.91,0:31:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean，like down- the- middle in half？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.63,0:31:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,At the waist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.09,0:31:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean this is the last time I can talk to the top half？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.46,0:31:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。The truck is the only thing that is holding her together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.47,0:31:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's say this is her bottom half.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.14,0:31:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I squeeze in a few minutes with that？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.14,0:31:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.31,0:31:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let me explain。- Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.82,0:31:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.49,0:31:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom，I'll need a ride home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.71,0:32:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，baby。How's it going？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm dying，Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.80,0:32:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't talk like that。The truck barely hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.68,0:32:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey，kiss me one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.97,0:32:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll never remarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.10,0:32:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And no sex，either.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。I didn't catch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.03,0:32:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No sex。- Honey，you're not speaking clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.24,0:32:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your injuries must be awful。- No sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.45,0:32:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cruel fate to shroud my wife's… - No sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.24,0:32:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …dying words in mystery。- No sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.83,0:32:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No sex！- Poor Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.87,0:32:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,We hardly knew her。She'll be missed terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.00,0:32:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jesus。- That's right，honey，go into the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.54,0:32:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.88,0:32:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just tell George，「Swing away.」
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.88,0:32:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Swing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.68,0:32:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。That you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.14,0:33:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Annie？Annie！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.60,0:33:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.60,0:33:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't call me dude。I'm not a stoner anymore，not since…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.90,0:33:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goodbye，Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.58,0:33:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry，Mr。and Mrs。Meeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.17,0:33:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda was a good friend
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,when she was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.13,0:33:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,My sweet，sweet Brenda。She looks so peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.31,0:33:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,If only God had taken us instead of our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.94,0:33:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,And knowing your Brenda like I did，I'd say she wishes the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,These just came today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:33:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Photos from a trip she took.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.45,0:34:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're blank。- Turn them around，honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.46,0:34:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.62,0:34:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who's this？- That's Ralph.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.96,0:34:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.01,0:34:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a boy。He's going to be an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smoke all you want。You're gonna get hit by a bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.48,0:34:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not fooling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.32,0:34:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cindy。- George.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.73,0:34:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Sue wanted to pay her respects to her teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.15,0:34:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You？- Brenda was my bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.49,0:34:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.83,0:34:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just the open coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.75,0:34:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe they just leave it out here like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.00,0:34:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- George，it's a wake。- Awake？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.25,0:34:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Brenda！It's a miracle！- No！George，stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.00,0:34:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you were dead！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.46,0:34:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sue，your teacher's alive！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.34,0:35:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- What did he say？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.80,0:35:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got your back，George！I got your back！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.35,0:35:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.19,0:35:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mahalik，she's alive！Brenda！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.02,0:35:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,George，stop！She's dead！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.53,0:35:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda！No！We won't lose you again！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mahalik，help！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.61,0:35:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.11,0:35:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's not breathing！- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.28,0:35:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Live，damn it！Live！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.28,0:35:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.83,0:35:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Live，damn it！Live！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.08,0:35:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me open her windpipe！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.79,0:35:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Charles！Charles，stop them！- Breathe！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.59,0:35:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone stop them！What are they doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.05,0:35:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get off！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.72,0:35:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's alive！She's alive！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.18,0:35:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wake up！Brenda，Brenda，breathe！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.74,0:36:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.82,0:36:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.29,0:36:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got something！I got something！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.79,0:36:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's it！- George！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.25,0:36:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the last time I try to bring anyone back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.09,0:36:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,George，don't get down on yourself。I know you were only trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.34,0:36:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a good，caring person，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.43,0:36:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,which is why I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.18,0:36:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Cindy，but I don't wanna screw your life up，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.31,0:36:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,The most caring thing I could do for everyone right now
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.31,0:36:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,is to just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.82,0:36:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,George！What about Sue？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.11,0:36:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Of course。Once I get Sue，then…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.95,0:36:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.29,0:36:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could really use a friend right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.79,0:36:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brenda's gone，Cody resents me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.17,0:37:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm caught up in something I can't even…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God，it's so hard！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.80,0:37:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you're beautiful and you're pressing up against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.64,0:37:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Cindy，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.06,0:37:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you'd never consider going out with a guy like me，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.73,0:37:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,but if you're not too busy tomorrow night…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.82,0:37:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that a yes？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.54,0:37:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy，did Brenda ever talk to you about a tape？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.33,0:37:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,She did mention something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.33,0:37:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I go upstairs and look around？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，go。Of course。Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.13,0:37:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody，I'll be right back，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.05,0:37:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're getting laid tonight。He doesn't know you're a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.95,0:38:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.53,0:39:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.57,0:39:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Willie Mays？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.54,0:39:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's gay？Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.75,0:39:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…me now？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.42,0:39:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.46,0:39:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you hear me now？- Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.96,0:39:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you hear me now？- Yes，perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Seven days。- Seven days？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.97,0:39:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。I'm gonna die next Monday？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.93,0:39:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。No，wait。Monday。That would be seven business days.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.55,0:40:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is seven days starting now。- So seven days to this very hour？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.64,0:40:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,My watch broke。How am I gonna know the exact hour？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.94,0:40:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget hours。This day，seven days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.65,0:40:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,But there's a holiday coming up。Do you count the holiday as a day？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.23,0:40:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that depends。What holiday？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.11,0:40:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Martin Luther King Day。- Then no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.32,0:40:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why not？Everybody at work is taking it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.57,0:40:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ，lady。I'm giving you seven friggin' days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.99,0:40:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can come over there now
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.88,0:40:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,and kill the shit out of you if you'd rather have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,George，I don't care what you say，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm signing you up for another rap battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.92,0:40:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mahalik，I told you。That part of my life is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.34,0:40:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said the same thing about getting with CJ's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.80,0:40:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But look at me。I'm still hitting that。- He's still hitting it，man！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.39,0:40:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,And she fine as shit！That's my sister！What？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.76,0:40:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter。I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.01,0:40:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what are you gonna do with the rest of your life，dawg？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.89,0:40:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.02,0:40:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.77,0:40:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe my brother was right。Maybe I should just settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.07,0:40:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's up，then？- Mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.19,0:40:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got another one，y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.28,0:40:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，George，man，you can't focus on that shit，man。Let that go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you gotta try this shit，George.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.13,0:41:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo，man，you got to take the lid off！- What's wrong with you，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.38,0:41:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，of course。- Sorry！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.55,0:41:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- George，something terrible has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.59,0:41:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.97,0:41:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cindy，are you okay？What's going on？- George！George，you have to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.85,0:41:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just watched this tape，the same tape that killed Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.23,0:41:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then the phone rang，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.14,0:41:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,and this voice said that I was gonna die in seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.77,0:41:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy，there's no such thing as a killer videotape.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.44,0:41:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell，yeah，there is！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.86,0:41:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,In fact，I know somebody who can definitely help you with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.90,0:41:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You do？Who？- Wait up，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.40,0:41:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard Jamal from 90th Street，he watched that tape last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.49,0:41:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And this morning he woke up dead。- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.33,0:41:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,How in the hell do you wake up dead？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.74,0:41:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause you're alive when you go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.29,0:41:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait。Just tell me who can help me。- So you telling me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.96,0:41:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you can go to bed dead and wake up alive？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.67,0:41:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't go to bed dead！Man，that shit would be redundant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.38,0:41:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just tell me who。- No，it wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.63,0:41:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause you can go to bed and not be dead，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.88,0:41:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you can die but not be in a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.63,0:41:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you are in a bed，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.97,0:41:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's how you wake up dead in the first place，fool！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.55,0:42:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！That's some quantum shit right there，man！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.64,0:42:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's what I'm talking about。- You should be teaching classes！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.72,0:42:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You steady dropping knowledge！- Just tell me who can help me！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.39,0:42:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Damn！- My Aunt ShaNeequa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.89,0:42:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her and her man are into all this weird shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.85,0:42:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,They saw the tape before anybody else knew about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.07,0:42:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matter of fact，you should go see them tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.36,0:42:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tonight？Yeah。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.61,0:42:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But who will take care of Cody？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.36,0:42:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,George，we're gonna have so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.28,0:42:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have some jigsaw puzzles and board games
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.45,0:42:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,and baseball cards in my room，and this really cool model airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.83,0:42:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna go get it。- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.29,0:42:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，so I made him a snack，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.79,0:42:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you can give him some warm milk if he can't go to sleep…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.75,0:42:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.84,0:42:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Everything's gonna be fine。- Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.59,0:42:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm great with kids。Heads up，Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.88,0:42:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in case of emergencies，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.72,0:42:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I left some numbers… - I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.22,0:42:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。You okay，kiddo？That a boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.90,0:42:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I guess that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.81,0:42:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，I'm off。- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.82,0:43:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，it's funny。All a child ever really wants is a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.99,0:43:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.03,0:43:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cody really likes you。- He's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.66,0:43:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.71,0:43:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bye。- Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.39,0:43:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.39,0:43:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're Cindy。Be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.69,0:43:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aunt ShaNeequa？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.61,0:43:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bingo。But you can call me the Oracle。And don't worry about that vase.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.32,0:43:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,What vase？Sorry，I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.70,0:43:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,That vase.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.45,0:43:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.59,0:43:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.22,0:44:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.97,0:44:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know why you've come。A great mystery lies ahead of you，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.52,0:44:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you must not shy away from the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.48,0:44:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only you can be the one who will…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.44,0:44:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Orpheus？- What，baby？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.78,0:44:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sweetie？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.11,0:44:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm watching the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.45,0:44:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you mind？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.12,0:44:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Lakers will win by 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.42,0:44:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So can you tell me about… - The tape？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.13,0:44:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。I watched it，and… - The phone rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.05,0:44:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。And then this voice said… - That you would die in seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.68,0:44:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，that's getting… - Extremely annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.18,0:44:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Try being married to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.93,0:44:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I catch shit about women I ain't slept with yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.94,0:44:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You made a copy of the tape。Let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.02,0:44:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.07,0:45:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,ShaNeequa，can you tell me if…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.41,0:45:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tape is connected to the crop circles and the aliens？Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.41,0:45:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's up to you to discover how for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.66,0:45:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look，it's a… - Cigarette？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.75,0:45:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was going to say 「lighthouse.」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.13,0:45:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find that lighthouse。It's your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.38,0:45:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。What is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.56,0:45:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.50,0:45:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.04,0:45:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，baby…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.63,0:46:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew that was gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.80,0:46:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.88,0:46:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell，no。Get your ass out the TV！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.76,0:46:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you？I'm gonna teach you not to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.43,0:46:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get out that TV！- Baby，no！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.60,0:46:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No！Let her go！Let her go！Let her go！- Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.52,0:46:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，we gonna get another lawsuit。Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.60,0:46:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,She spit on me。I'll kill the bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.36,0:46:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You won。You won。You won。You won.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.49,0:46:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Upstairs。Upstairs。- Okay。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.90,0:46:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Down low。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.11,0:46:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right。- Baby，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.70,0:46:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kill her！Is you crazy？Is you crazy？- Baby！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.99,0:46:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What you gonna brush now？- Cool down.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.33,0:46:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you gonna brush now，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.54,0:46:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You picked the wrong TV to come out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.71,0:46:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,George？Cody？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.22,0:46:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,George？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.76,0:46:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What happened？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.89,0:47:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody and I were playing a fun game，and then I looked down and…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.35,0:47:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yahtzee！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.40,0:47:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.41,0:47:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.62,0:47:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How could you let him watch the tape？- I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.63,0:47:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.26,0:47:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How you doing？- Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.80,0:47:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enjoying your last week？I can't wait to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.59,0:47:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Six days now，right？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.51,0:47:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it was great catching up，but can I speak to Cody？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.14,0:47:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？He didn't watch the tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.52,0:47:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，he did。Come on，Cindy，I do this for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.48,0:47:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave us alone！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.49,0:47:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- Hello，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.91,0:47:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm calling from Reader's Digest with a fantastic offer for Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.62,0:48:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you're not！You're that evil little girl from the tape！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.16,0:48:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，you got me。How about I just leave a message for him？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.46,0:48:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.96,0:48:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Okay，how do you spell that？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.59,0:48:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Okay，got it。Bye- bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.81,0:48:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can't believe you let that happen。- I know。I'm sorry，I screwed up…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.81,0:48:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，we can still save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.90,0:48:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,The answer to the tape，to your crop circles，is at a lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.74,0:48:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You think I'm crazy，don't you？- Of course I do，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.74,0:48:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,but the last thing you need now is a screw- up like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.95,0:48:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna leave for good。- Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.66,0:48:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what should I tell Cody？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.58,0:48:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let him down easy。Tell him I got called away on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.55,0:48:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.59,0:48:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Testicular cancer。He won't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.01,0:48:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I knew you'd understand。- George！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.26,0:49:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just be careful。Something weird is going on at your farm。I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.35,0:49:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.73,0:49:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sometimes a sheep just needs to be pushed through the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.98,0:49:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Goodbye，Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.13,0:49:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sue？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.39,0:49:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's way past your bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.56,0:49:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Won't you rock me to sleep in your big，strong arms？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.48,0:49:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's plenty of room under the covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.19,0:49:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a hot night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.57,0:49:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't need to wear pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.49,0:49:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is my daughter？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.86,0:50:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you mad？I am your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.20,0:50:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you're not！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.08,0:50:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.91,0:50:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What did you do with Sue？- I didn't touch her。I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.71,0:50:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't believe you！- Please！For God's sakes，she's a girl！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.42,0:50:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sick…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.69,0:50:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.28,0:50:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you like it，huh？Having fun？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.92,0:51:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom，are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.39,0:51:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What in the world？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.14,0:51:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.10,0:51:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that thing？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.14,0:51:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.40,0:51:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe Cindy was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.50,0:51:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，sir。All I need is five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.83,0:51:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I told you，Campbell，no more paranoid on- air rants
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.00,0:51:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,about the supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.63,0:51:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。This station is about sex，violence and the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.26,0:51:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.01,0:51:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna need that 「Porn Star Shot Dead in a Hurricane」 story.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.01,0:51:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,One hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.64,0:51:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meanwhile，a tornado in Charleston
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.02,0:51:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,threatens a clothing- optional beach where，just yesterday，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.69,0:51:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,a naked couple was brutally murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.02,0:51:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This just five miles from the spot… - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.86,0:51:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…where the last naked couple was brutally murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.36,0:52:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turning now to sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.61,0:52:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,And an evil videotape that kills anyone who watches it in seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.53,0:52:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's true。We're all in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.04,0:52:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There's an alien force out there… - Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.70,0:52:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that's trying to prevent you from knowing the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.12,0:52:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Campbell，are you insane？- Trust me，it's a horrible fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.50,0:52:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Carson，I have to do this。- Do you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.71,0:52:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Correction，there really is no danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.88,0:52:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I didn't really mean anything I just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.05,0:52:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I did。Every word of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.55,0:52:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone watching this could be dead in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.23,0:52:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,1-3-4-19…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.23,0:52:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,4-6-9…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.36,0:52:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I been cleaning after this dumb- ass cracker，Giggins，for 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.40,0:52:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I been waxing his bitch's ass for 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.07,0:52:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Know what I'm saying，nigger？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.66,0:52:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ride that ho like your mama rides the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.58,0:52:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,She likes her some chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.41,0:52:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sharpton for President，y'all。I'm outty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.58,0:52:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.71,0:52:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,An evil videotape that kills people in seven days？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.59,0:53:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alien forces threatening the world？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.71,0:53:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who in the hell is this Cindy Campbell？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.55,0:53:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,If what she says is true，we're facing an unprecedented crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.34,0:53:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get me the President。- You are the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.76,0:53:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Then I already know about this。Let's order lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.43,0:53:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，I think you need to go on TV
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.06,0:53:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,and convince the people that there is no such thing as a UFO.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.77,0:53:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't spell in front of me，damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.44,0:53:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aliens，sir。There's no such thing as aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.45,0:53:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's not quite true。- Sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.28,0:53:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,A year ago，a UFO crash- landed in New Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.62,0:53:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A body may have been recovered。- 「May have been」？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.45,0:53:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there was a terrible mix- up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.37,0:53:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was Thanksgiving。The body was sent down to the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.79,0:53:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,They shoved stuffing up its ass，and we ate it at a state dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.71,0:53:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the last I saw of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.26,0:53:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，scratch that。There were some sandwiches made the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.93,0:53:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。President！Listen to me carefully。- Agent Thompson！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.64,0:53:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back away from that window！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.39,0:53:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Did I forget to put my pants on again？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.89,0:53:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.79,0:53:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a feeling I've been having since the news about the aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.65,0:54:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Something's not right。- I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.82,0:54:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like that feeling that something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.11,0:54:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.32,0:54:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some old Tupac，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.49,0:54:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,All Eyez on Me。Hey，this shit is banging.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.00,0:54:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，sir。I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.57,0:55:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.08,0:55:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am the Architect。You have many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.75,0:55:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been watching you for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.26,0:55:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.88,0:55:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what is the connection between the crop circles and the videotape？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.68,0:55:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,The answer is simple。You are the eventuality of an anomaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.22,0:55:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are inexorably seeking a sedulant probability.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.89,0:56:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「Sedulant」？- Grotesquery？No？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.77,0:56:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about 「contingent affirmation」？That's got to mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.07,0:56:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Hey！You put cameras in my bathroom？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.28,0:56:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't… What is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.70,0:56:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。Well，it was a long winter。I…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.08,0:56:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is an invasion of… - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.83,0:56:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't help it。It's very lonely in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.75,0:56:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ergo，I haven't been with anyone in a very long time，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.92,0:56:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,not counting myself，or this chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.22,0:56:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I call her… Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.09,0:56:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you just cut to the chase？I'm kind of in a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.30,0:56:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？You can always sleep over if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.64,0:56:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Linda's built for two，and she vibrates.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.81,0:56:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it！Just tell me what I need to know！Who is that little girl？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.23,0:56:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.15,0:56:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,My wife and I wanted a child，but she couldn't get pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.61,0:56:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Neither could I。- So you adopted？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.66,0:56:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,We loved our daughter，but she was evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.28,0:57:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Made the horses crazy，killed our puppies，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.64,0:57:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,hid the remote，really sick shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.16,0:57:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,My wife took her to the old family farm and drowned her in the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.00,0:57:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I felt a simple time- out would've been sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.30,0:57:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Tabitha imprinted her evil on a videotape.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.01,0:57:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I never meant for it to get out，but… - But what？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I put it in the wrong box and returned it to Blockbuster，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.35,0:57:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,instead of my copy of Pootie Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.52,0:57:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it's been circulating and killing ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.35,0:57:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like Pootie Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.36,0:57:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But what does this have to do with aliens？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.19,0:57:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps Tabitha's summoning them to kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.15,0:57:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,An alien invasion？I have to warn the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.03,0:57:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's already begun。You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.20,0:57:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.08,0:57:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,But not too late to make an old man happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.04,0:57:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？What？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.17,0:57:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now，reports of lights in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.05,0:57:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Glimpses of spacecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.47,0:57:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Possible alien sightings being reported all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.51,0:57:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are they aliens？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.01,0:58:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first video images are coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.56,0:58:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Disturbing home video tonight from a ranch outside Sydney，Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.73,0:58:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch very carefully now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.23,0:58:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,There。There it is。Let's see that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.19,0:58:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very，very disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this just in from So Paulo，Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.74,0:58:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's see that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.58,0:58:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very，very disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.04,0:58:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this just in from south Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.05,0:58:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do they pose a threat？Only one thing's for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.35,0:58:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are all going to be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.39,0:58:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to board up the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.93,0:58:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is necessary，Wilson？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.60,0:58:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Having an awards ceremony at a time like this？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.85,0:58:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir。Everything must appear business as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.07,0:58:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The nation，while not yet panicked，is deeply disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.94,0:58:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Good，let's see if we can steer that course，
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.61,0:59:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,keeping everybody deeply disturbed。We don't want a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.03,0:59:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very few presidents have faced a crisis like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.62,0:59:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder what President Ford would've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.62,0:59:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if the buck stops here，the buck stops here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.84,0:59:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，all，and welcome to the White House.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.59,0:59:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Mother Teresa Awards recognize those
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.63,0:59:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,who have overcome the severest handicaps and disadvantages
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.72,0:59:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,to help others in their communities.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.06,0:59:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,The young，the old，black and white.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.31,0:59:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our Native- American friends。Hey，how are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.27,0:59:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how are you？Hey，how are you？Hey，how are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.15,0:59:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it is therefore my honor
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.57,0:59:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,to present each and every one of you with this symbol of merit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.62,0:59:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,The room is secure，Mr。President.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.83,0:59:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Or is it？- Sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.75,0:59:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been thinking，Thompson.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.67,0:59:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if the aliens could take over human bodies？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.84,1:00:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'd look just like us，or almost.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.63,1:00:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never thought of that，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.34,1:00:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should be on alert for anything suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.85,1:00:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They could be anywhere，even… - Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.81,1:00:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,My God。We'd never see the attack coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.52,1:00:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's frightening，sir！- Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.94,1:00:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll just move slowly toward the exit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.61,1:00:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,At last we meet，Mr。President.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.36,1:00:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's happening。I knew it！You'll never take me alive！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.28,1:00:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's scrambling my brain！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.83,1:00:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll get her！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.21,1:00:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you don't！Not on my watch！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.00,1:00:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good work，sir！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.38,1:00:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good God！The small ones have metal teeth！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.84,1:00:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jerry's Kids，my ass！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.89,1:00:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。President！Mr。President，have you gone completely insane？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.31,1:00:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like a fox.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.77,1:00:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,We gotta talk to the one person who saw this coming，Cindy Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.06,1:00:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,She knows how to defeat the aliens，these filthy，rotten scum！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.57,1:01:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hideous creature！Get off my planet！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.19,1:01:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.53,1:01:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。President，is everything all right？- The exits are all blocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.20,1:01:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll find one，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.74,1:01:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody，clear！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.04,1:01:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way，sir！God，this is exciting！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.08,1:01:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're excited？You should feel my nipples.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.34,1:01:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody？Cody？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.59,1:01:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody，where are you？Honey？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.26,1:01:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,After today's incident in the East Room，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.59,1:01:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,the White House is now advising all citizens
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.18,1:01:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,to board up their homes and prepare for an alien invasion.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.39,1:01:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.98,1:01:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now，a News 8 exclusive，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.60,1:01:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,the killer videotape you've been hearing about.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.94,1:01:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No… - We're the only station that has it，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.57,1:01:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we're showing it all night。Very exciting。Let's roll it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.70,1:01:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,There。Nobody's getting through that sucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.45,1:01:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's great，George，but we have to get down to the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.04,1:01:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- George。- Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.96,1:01:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no time。Get down to the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.75,1:02:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cody！Thank God！- Aunt Cindy！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.21,1:02:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've been worried sick about you。- He just showed up about an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.51,1:02:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I tried to call。- No，he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.38,1:02:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，but I was gonna。- No，he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.43,1:02:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Cody，the point is you can't just run away like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.98,1:02:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanted to be with George.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.64,1:02:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey，I know you want a dad，but…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.65,1:02:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me，Cody，I'm not good at anything。Why would I be good at that？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.07,1:02:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uncle George！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.00,1:02:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay，Cody.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.33,1:02:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to die，aren't I？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.92,1:02:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody，did I ever tell you what your mom said about you the day you were born？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.80,1:02:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.09,1:02:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was in the delivery room with her。She was having a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.22,1:02:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you began to come out of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.98,1:02:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,And your mom screamed and screamed in pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.31,1:03:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,She yelled，「Just kill me。Bludgeon me with a bedpan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.81,1:03:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Whatever you do，put me out of this pain.」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.69,1:03:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was gushing torrents of blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.99,1:03:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have this all on tape if you wanna see it someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.70,1:03:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，finally you came out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.78,1:03:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mom cut your umbilical cord herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.62,1:03:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，on the second try.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.33,1:03:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first time，she snipped your penis in half.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.33,1:03:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,After all，she was drunk。Actually，drugged.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.50,1:03:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd been out the night before，celebrating Saint Patrick's Day，
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.21,1:03:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,and she thought，「Hey，I never tasted crystal meth.」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.72,1:03:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,So she did just a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.72,1:03:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My penis？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.10,1:03:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,They sewed it on upside- down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.47,1:03:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So that's why I pee up？- Yes。We'll get it fixed，honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.89,1:03:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's on my list of things。Right after we get TiVo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.81,1:03:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，there you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.69,1:03:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,And your mom turned to me，and she said 「Hey，you want him？Take him.」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.57,1:03:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then she died。And I took you。Do you know why？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.91,1:03:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had just lost my cat in a fire，and I needed something to pet and feed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.00,1:04:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I miss that cat，Cody.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.58,1:04:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I love you，and nothing's ever gonna change that，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.42,1:04:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,not even the very painful death we're about to experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.09,1:04:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,George！George.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.06,1:04:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are they gone？- I don't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.23,1:04:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't worry，Sue。It'll be all right。- It was Uncle George.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.28,1:04:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.78,1:04:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good work，Sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.28,1:04:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what stupid，idiotic thing made these lights go off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.75,1:04:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，there's some spare fuses in the crawlspace.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.04,1:04:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I can get to them，I can get these lights back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.09,1:04:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick，George，grab that railroad tie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.63,1:04:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jam it against the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.47,1:04:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,My balls！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.22,1:04:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not those！Jesus！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.31,1:05:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.60,1:05:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uncle George！I'm scared！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.06,1:05:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sweetie，come here。It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.61,1:05:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something on the other side of the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.12,1:05:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.85,1:05:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.10,1:05:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you see them？What are they doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.52,1:05:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're horrible。They're grayish with big black eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.52,1:05:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their teeth are grotesque.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.53,1:05:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think they're giggling。- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.11,1:05:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.49,1:06:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，I think…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.45,1:06:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think they wanna eat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.04,1:06:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Help！- Cody！Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.71,1:06:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,George。Swing away，George.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.88,1:06:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm coming，Cody。I'll save you。- Aunt Cindy，help！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.01,1:06:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Die！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.72,1:06:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Die！You damn aliens，let him go！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.39,1:06:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not getting in here！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.31,1:06:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What else you got？Bring it！- George…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.56,1:06:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,There！Had enough？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.23,1:06:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget it，Cody。Thank me later.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.98,1:06:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cody。Thank God。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.07,1:06:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Daddy！Daddy！- Sue！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.58,1:06:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mahalik，what are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.91,1:06:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man，I told you the 'hood's always got your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.87,1:06:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank God。There's two of them at the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.08,1:06:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.50,1:06:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。They couldn't get in。I hear they can't open doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.21,1:06:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,They mastered space flight，but they can't get through a wooden door？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.76,1:07:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，the cellar's the safest place.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.01,1:07:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say all the women and children stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.60,1:07:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，and the men，we go outside and fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.27,1:07:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。And what's the cut- off age for children？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.85,1:07:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.00,1:07:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.05,1:07:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。I thought I was hitting the brake.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.97,1:07:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，we don't have to go through insurance，do we？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.06,1:07:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。President，what are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.27,1:07:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm looking for Cindy Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.64,1:07:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,She may hold the key to defeating the aliens.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.40,1:07:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。The Air Force is here with those new round planes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.61,1:08:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't have round planes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.41,1:08:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.62,1:08:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。Do you hear that？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.76,1:08:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo，what's up，George？- CJ！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.63,1:08:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you，the 'hood always got your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.68,1:08:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I got the boys with me。Get out the car，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.01,1:08:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo，who we gonna shoot？- Y'all ready to go step？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.52,1:08:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，let's go do this，'cause I'm hyped right now，B！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.93,1:08:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm real hyped！- You stepped on my shoe，bitch！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.19,1:08:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call me another bitch again，and I'll park your truck dead in your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.19,1:08:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Calm down，man。- Damn，homey！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.23,1:08:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- In the cornfield。- They're coming！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.65,1:08:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look，don't even worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.78,1:08:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me and my boys here，we gonna go ahead and take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.70,1:08:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，yo，come on，let's start it！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.86,1:08:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I was you，son，I'd bust this shit right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.45,1:08:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your mama！- I got your number，too，homey.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.28,1:08:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！We over here，y'all！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.37,1:08:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,He ain't gonna bust nothing。I got nuts bigger than him，ya heard？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.87,1:08:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Percival，you country- ass，maple- syrup nigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.83,1:08:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Y'all want some biscuits？You want some biscuits？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.67,1:09:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！Get down！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I just saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.72,1:09:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,These men died for their country。Send flowers to their bitches and hos.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.19,1:09:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't break free！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.36,1:09:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think！They must have some kind of weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.58,1:09:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found it！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.91,1:09:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Without their heads，they're powerless！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.92,1:09:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，no。We mean you no harm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.08,1:09:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,We traveled to your planet to find an evil little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.17,1:09:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We must destroy her before seven days.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.38,1:09:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean you watched the videotape？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.88,1:09:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our satellite picked up what we thought was Pootie Tang.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.39,1:09:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.10,1:09:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now our entire race will die unless the girl is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.48,1:09:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- See？They are peaceful。- Well，if they're so peaceful，man，
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.27,1:10:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,why were they choking us a few minutes ago？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.52,1:10:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's how we say hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.24,1:10:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello！Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.07,1:10:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello，hello。- Hello，hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.70,1:10:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，how do you guys say goodbye？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.20,1:10:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.62,1:10:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you think that's strange，you should see how we pee.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.88,1:10:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,So we're not so different after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.68,1:10:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something about this place。It's like I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.27,1:10:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.65,1:10:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,This used to be their farm。She died right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.08,1:11:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.03,1:11:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Push back。Follow through.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.03,1:11:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Follow through。- Yeah。You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.45,1:11:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just look at this。Human beings and aliens working together.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.70,1:11:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're all just one big galactic family.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.46,1:11:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Family。That's just what I've been running away from.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.38,1:11:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that's because you're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.51,1:11:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.89,1:12:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,My wife took her to the old family farm and drowned her in the well.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.36,1:12:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,The little girl。She's frightened of the well.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.80,1:12:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.96,1:13:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to go back down the well，bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.05,1:13:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cindy！- No。Don't hurt him！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.60,1:13:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy，you have to come outside。The aliens aren't invading…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.48,1:13:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，Cody。I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.85,1:13:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！Wait。Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.07,1:13:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have to be evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.57,1:13:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what happened to you，Tabitha.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.62,1:13:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what your mom did。That was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.24,1:13:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were just a little girl。And you're still that little girl，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.33,1:13:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,just a lot more corpsy and with really bad teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.59,1:13:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,But maybe all you need is a mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.43,1:13:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,And a father.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.02,1:14:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We could be… - A family.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.87,1:14:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.83,1:14:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your love has broken the curse and freed my soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.37,1:14:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll never have to kill again。- Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.92,1:14:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nah！I'm just screwing with you！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.05,1:14:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just want to tell you both good luck。We're all counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.85,1:14:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now it's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.86,1:14:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，it's okay。He's our friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.86,1:14:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving our species。Now we must return to our home planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.70,1:14:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goodbye，then.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.07,1:15:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.76,1:15:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，congratulations，George！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.05,1:15:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know the 'hood always got your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.18,1:15:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.40,1:15:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bye！- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.46,1:15:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,George，I'm so happy。Finally we're a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.46,1:15:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。You，me，and…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.71,1:15:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Damn！- Damn！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.22,1:16:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cindy！George！Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌电视
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让我头痛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.65,0:00:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多电磁波在空间里流窜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为电视和电视机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们丧失了十倍的脑细胞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛会呜呜叫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,电波和脑细胞…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.63,0:00:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道其中有何关连
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我听说了什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,电波会让矽胶愈缩愈小
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 关掉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 遥控失灵了 - 你拿反了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么办 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 变小我可完了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你多漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能拥有你的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.66,0:01:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能拥有你的咪咪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我希望能拥有你的… - 白虎苞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是每个人都有的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 好像有点恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还知道更恐怖的事 - 什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.47,0:01:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听过录影带的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.89,0:01:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他们在船上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又车震 又在浴缸里做的那卷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.18,0:01:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 「宝贝我爱你」 然后她说 「我们在哪里」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有… - 不 不是那一卷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有恐怖影像的那卷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看完录影带 电话就响了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.07,0:02:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,传出恐怖的声音 说你快死了 就在…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,七天之内 我知道 上星期我和乔许看过了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上星期和乔许在一起 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这荡妇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真诡异 - 对呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大的房子 只有一具电话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 宝贝…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨老妈 - 嗨 宝贝 好玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啦 正想去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:47.55,Title,0,0,0,0,,《惊声尖笑3》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆你听见…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.55,0:05:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗狗怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干嘛 我们担心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他们想表达什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请收看华盛顿最受欢迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,新闻节目
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安我是罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的焦点新闻就交给辛蒂咯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前在中堡的最新消息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地农夫汤姆的玉米田里出现了神秘的麦田圈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人为的恶作剧 还是来自外星的现象
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有最新消息 我们将随时插播报道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小镇上确实发生了奇特事件 罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,报歉我没听到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要转台 我们马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 辛蒂 有空吗 - 有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去看看这个重要的脱衣俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想继续追麦田圈的新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 那只是恶作剧罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听我的 我觉得玉米田里有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是女性直觉或是「新店杆」也好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我觉得危险来了 我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的眼 - 辛蒂 这是结算月了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,收视率决定一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家喜欢有趣的新闻 像昨天做的那一则
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,隆乳的那一则
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是10分钟的上空女郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有啥有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:07:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们不在乎这个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要的是硬里子新闻 有深度的话题 还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是克里森兄弟搞的鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我的玉米毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我付不出钱 银行就会没收我的抵押品
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有六十天可以筹钱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 你不应该再遭遇困境的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.31,0:08:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老婆发生了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长我不要你的同情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要惹你伤心神父
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我不做神父很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那一夜便失去了信仰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会重拾信仰的 就像太阳一定从东方升起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听来机会不大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着每个现象都有原因
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是克里森兄弟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我跟他们谈过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的田里就很久都不会出现怪事了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧 汤姆 休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚你接到苏之后 我要你回这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那台拖拉机需要修理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉老兄 我不能帮你 我得为表演做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会又是那愚蠢的嘻哈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 乔治 你何时才能认真过活
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有个梦想 - 什么梦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是继续做梦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:10:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 你只是在追寻青少年时期的幻想罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做太空人 牛仔…名女人的妇产科医师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在则想当嘻哈歌手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你知道一下哦 唱嘻哈有钱可领
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天晚上的饶舌歌比赛我将拔得头筹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶舌歌比赛 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你讨厌我 因为我是黑人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不相信了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你管好自己就够了 我的事我自己…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又迟到了 辛蒂阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 塞车嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.14,0:10:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 辛蒂 - 布兰达嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好久不见 - 太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我工作太忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得花很多时间待在电视台
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直有新闻进来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,功课是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,画家人和朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近有新男人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 没有适合的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的不只是性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你需要承诺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要性高潮 当我遇到适合的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要强强滚的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟你翻云覆雨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在说啥吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有叫你们停笔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他望着你的样子就好像他想把你砍了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达你好浪漫啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着遇到适合的人时我会知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨甜心 过来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:11:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿东西好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你 你是汤姆的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是那个记者 辛蒂 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你报道我们的麦片圈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是麦田圈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你是来接…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,外甥 科迪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的穿着不像个农夫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥才是农夫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是饶舌歌手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的 来打611查点资讯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是障碍台 你要说的是411查号台吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚我在23俱乐部参加饶舌歌比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不相信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不信 你们要来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会饶舌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.67,0:12:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,帽子我戴鸭舌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唱的真好 - 我会杀蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,乒乒砰砰唷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们答应去 你可以住嘴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:13:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就酱子 明天晚上见了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.27,0:13:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好再见 - 拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个王八蛋搞的鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 怎么了 你又看到那东西了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女孩 黑头发的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的月经快来了三…二…一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么 科迪 你还见到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男孩和一个女人 可是没看到爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 科迪 - 我看到你跪在狗屎里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们能在一起 这样就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪 我知道你母亲死后 你很不好受
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是太自私了 总是以事业为重
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始我会整天想着你…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我会离开一阵子 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她有时候她会跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚她会来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫顿神父 - 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很谢谢你过来 我一直打电话找保姆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔找我没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科迪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 他应该在房里在玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要叫他洗澡洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他屁股上有个小疹子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以帮他在小屁屁上擦乳液吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要轻轻擦就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 神父 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 今天真是人多多呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着在今晚的比赛开始前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做几点宣布
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.61,0:15:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们都想干掉心中最喜欢的饶舌歌手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 请克制一下想开枪的冲动 等到比赛结束再说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 先把保险关上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在扳机的左手边上方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把他轰出去好吗 把他赶走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.05,0:16:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 DJ 放音乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的错 - 去你妈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达 怎么了 你看起来吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 你在电视上说的事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有预感怪事要发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像看到女生开车时那种预感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:16:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚看完秀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没跟陌生人回家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,或喝到脱裤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,醉倒在厨房后面的垃圾箱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以过来陪我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想独处
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然好 布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天门票算你的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷 乔治 还好吗 最强的饶舌歌手来也
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还好吗 老兄 有啥新鲜事 - 在街上 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.62,0:17:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最近有啥新闻 - 哥们！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有啥新鲜事 - 哥们！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,白人终于要教教黑人如何饶舌啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 耶 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说 - 你觉得今天有多少观众
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天我不知耶 一百 两百个带家伙的白人憎恨者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着轰掉烂歌手的头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶 差不多哦 对呀 - 说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…又怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过远离虚幻世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到现实
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如远离这里挪到那里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.65,0:17:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的姑妈曾住在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:17:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不过那三八被赶走了 - 说啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:17:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是哦 - 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老鼠 - 老鼠 我以为她养了田鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,田鼠在户外生活 老鼠在家里生活
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果老鼠跑到外头去 就变成田鼠罗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果田鼠待在家里 会变成老鼠吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在外头看过老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它变成田鼠了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇靠 你刚陈述了一项事实 真的很深奥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兄弟 在谈些什么 - 太火了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 你需要什么吗 什么事我都能帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那些带家伙又恨白人的兄弟…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他需要个宣传 - 说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 耶 没错 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会变成巨星
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是 就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你会炒作 一定大卖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.03,0:18:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是失败还是成功呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能逃避你的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我数钞票 你只要躺着干就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦好啦 真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才叫正点 超棒的 对吧 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷 你觉得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.39,0:19:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们都很讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常讨人厌 - 啥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我来干嘛的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真是太惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人举起手来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 准备好了吗 乔治 上场了 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 我想告诉你 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.91,0:19:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论今晚表现如何
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心都将与你同在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真情 真情流漏唷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 这样就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 兄弟 能感觉到吗 - 这也是我要说的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兄弟 到这儿来 - 你会感觉我的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你感觉到吗 - 我无法闪避
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 来吧 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.43,0:19:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是这样 - 兄弟 上台去好好来一曲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚要大放异彩 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.69,0:19:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是兄弟 - 不该互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:19:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们彼此友爱 - 我来介绍你出场
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上场吧 宝贝 我们罩你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 准备看下一个表演了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我左边 是从阿帕契来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫冕冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,BS 1-1-1
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人称呼他超级忌妒王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人称呼他卡塔吉纳先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有人叫他乔伊毁灭者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 投降吧 - 今晚我们为大胖乔鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跟他拼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃吧 放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想他们是来看大胖乔的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 乔 乔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们在喊 「上 上 上」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请挑战者上场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子是个农夫 所以他整天在饶舌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位观众 请欢迎我兄弟 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么话 耶 耶 来吧各位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 举起手来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.37,0:20:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 乔伊毁灭者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是冠军 所以你先呛声
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷DJ音乐放下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙不可能成大器
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,个头比我小 他怎么跟我比
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有玉米一堆 可他无啥小路用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他无啥大碍 但也构不成我的灾害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤感情 但你真的没行情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.23,0:21:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他成不了气候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.77,0:21:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是大海里的虾米 可是我是鲸鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再管牛和牛奶了 乳臭未干的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟堂妹努力做人算了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是已经做了 你的一号歌迷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来只是唯一
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是王牌的…大骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.17,0:21:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,打赌你会比我早死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然敢跟我挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你还是去医狂牛症比较划算
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要让我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,八英里外的农场才是你家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.85,0:21:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 非常热闹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:22:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常紧凑的表演大胖乔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷 各位观众 请欢迎我兄弟 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷DJ音乐催下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,调音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.08,0:22:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.01,0:22:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,202区的各位兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手举起来 因为大胖乔非常酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,202区的各位兄弟 热起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,照过来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个白人 可我是个硬汉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我涂美乃滋决不怠慢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.07,0:22:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脸色不好 可我没蹲过苦牢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和萧蔷每个冬天都到玉山报到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟几个女生睡过 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.03,0:22:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎史都华是我的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在农场长大 没有节奏感
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲力医师是我叔叔 我喜欢有他做伴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会跳舞 我穿卡其裤
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小名叫阿杜 我奶奶来自法国
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.51,0:23:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我很逊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.13,0:23:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不够黑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.31,0:23:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们不能笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.48,0:23:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 202因为我够酷 - 202因为我够酷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为乔治鼓掌 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.52,0:23:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 那是我兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.48,0:23:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.91,0:23:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔治 乔治 帽子 - 该死不
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别戴了 - 我知道我们是一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 老兄 - 他完了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还认得我吗 戴着帽子的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.84,0:23:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样我尝试过了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.01,0:23:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你不能就这样放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:23:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶舌歌最烂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.85,0:24:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你还是能唱 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.73,0:24:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你过来 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.90,0:24:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我只是太累了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.69,0:24:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达…要不要告诉我你究竟在烦什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.61,0:24:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…我有事要说…我看了一卷录影带
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.53,0:24:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该让你知道这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.62,0:24:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,里头的影像很吓人 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.58,0:24:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达那是忏悔星期二节
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没喝过伏特加 也没有珠子可给
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.46,0:24:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是那卷 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那只是个传说…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那卷带子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一结束 你的电话铃会响起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.01,0:24:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个恐怖的声音会说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.02,0:24:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「七天后就是你的死期」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.10,0:24:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了七天后…你什么时候看的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.56,0:24:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一星期前
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.48,0:24:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一星期前的今晚 - 布兰达…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:24:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.28,0:25:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.62,0:25:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 死三八
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.63,0:25:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是番茄酱啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.09,0:25:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该看看自己的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我骗倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.22,0:25:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达 布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.93,0:25:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.73,0:25:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没想到你会被骗 - 可是很逼真啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.16,0:25:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧 很逼真吧 - 而且你还尿出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.54,0:25:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 我弄得很像真的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是喜欢看你被吓到的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.33,0:25:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太容易上当了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.80,0:26:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用以前那只假手骗你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.14,0:26:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小姐你还真害怕 - 对啦对啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.93,0:26:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 开玩笑而已 - 太过火了 布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.90,0:26:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿剩下的爆米花
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.53,0:26:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.66,0:26:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了 我不会再受骗的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.55,0:26:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂 是新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.85,0:26:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有一个白人女孩掉进井里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.73,0:26:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天有50个黑人被警察刑求
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界却把焦点放在一个白人女孩身上
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.11,0:27:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.70,0:27:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视机在漏水
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.37,0:27:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.37,0:27:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂 这里怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.10,0:27:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂这三八把我地板弄湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.48,0:27:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.23,0:27:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听见
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.40,0:27:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来你这小三八
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.95,0:27:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 让我看看你的能耐
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会什么 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.08,0:27:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会打败她的 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.96,0:27:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样呀
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.22,0:28:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂 救命辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.94,0:28:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 等一下 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.11,0:28:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莫顿神父 我们相处得很愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.94,0:28:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 神父 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.19,0:28:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.70,0:28:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.13,0:28:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 当然我会告诉她 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.85,0:28:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏的老师布兰达…她…她死了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.48,0:28:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我最好跟她说 - 不不不 我可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.65,0:29:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.70,0:29:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认识布兰达老师吧 - 认识啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.70,0:29:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.95,0:29:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不回来了 死得好惨
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.96,0:29:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了 死透了 像你的狗狗一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.46,0:29:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的狗狗死了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.71,0:29:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来的时候压到它
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.34,0:29:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱的每个人都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.35,0:29:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨神父
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫我神父 我不当神父很久了自从…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.36,0:29:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚的事我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.40,0:29:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那20英里路我没打瞌睡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.87,0:29:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没有喝光整瓶酒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.45,0:30:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没杀了那个搭便车的人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.21,0:30:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沙亚蔓… - 如果当时我没被抓到
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.96,0:30:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那房间跟2个男孩…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.71,0:30:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的和安妮都没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.09,0:30:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我想到别晚去了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.85,0:30:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过如果发生在那一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我不会撞到她 可怕的那一晚…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.96,0:30:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神父 是您夫人 她受伤了 - 安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.75,0:30:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被卡车撞到 卡在树上动弹不得
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.75,0:30:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.21,0:30:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要不移开卡车她就一息尚存
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.26,0:30:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.10,0:31:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你太太
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.10,0:31:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的热狗折断了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.36,0:31:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细看这薄饼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.53,0:31:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么深的譬喻我看不懂 我只想见见安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.74,0:31:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被撞成两截了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.91,0:31:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说…从中间折一半了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.63,0:31:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从腰部
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.09,0:31:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这是我最后一次跟她的上半身讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.46,0:31:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是卡车让她暂时黏在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.47,0:31:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设这是她的下半身
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.14,0:31:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以跟那里温存一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.14,0:31:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.31,0:31:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我解释给你听 - 汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.82,0:31:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.49,0:31:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆我想搭便车
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.71,0:32:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要死了 汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.80,0:32:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么说 卡车差点撞到你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.68,0:32:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 吻我最后一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.97,0:32:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我你不会再娶
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.10,0:32:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能乱搞
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.03,0:32:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能跟人上床 - 亲爱的 你口齿不清了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.24,0:32:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的伤势太严重 - 不能跟人上床
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.45,0:32:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 命运之神何其残忍 - 不能跟人上床
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.24,0:32:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我听不懂吾妻临终之言 - 不能跟人上床
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.83,0:32:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能跟人上床 - 可怜的安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.87,0:32:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们太不了解她了 我们会很想念她的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.00,0:32:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天爷 - 好的 亲爱的 安息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.54,0:32:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.88,0:32:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟乔治说 尽情挥棒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.88,0:32:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 尽情挥棒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.68,0:32:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句你又听懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.14,0:33:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮 安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.60,0:33:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.60,0:33:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫我老兄 我很久没抽大麻了自从…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.90,0:33:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜了 汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.58,0:33:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉米克斯先生太太
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.17,0:33:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达生前是个好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可爱的布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.13,0:33:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来很平静
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.31,0:33:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝应该召唤我来代替女儿死的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.94,0:33:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解布兰达 她心中也一定这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天才收到的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:33:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她旅行时拍的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.45,0:34:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么都没有 - 请翻面 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.46,0:34:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.62,0:34:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是谁 - 雷夫
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.96,0:34:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.01,0:34:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个男孩 他以后会变成混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量抽吧 反正你会被公车撞死
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.48,0:34:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,假发骗不了人的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.32,0:34:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 辛蒂 - 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.73,0:34:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏想向她的老师致意
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.15,0:34:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢 - 对 布兰达是我好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.49,0:34:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.83,0:34:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为棺材还开着
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.75,0:34:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信他们就这么摆着
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.00,0:34:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔治她醒了 - 醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.25,0:34:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布兰达 奇迹出现了 - 不 乔治 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.00,0:34:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你死了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.46,0:34:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏 你的老师复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.34,0:35:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈…罗 - 他说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.80,0:35:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来罩你 乔治 我来罩你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.35,0:35:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.19,0:35:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着 布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.02,0:35:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 不要 她已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.53,0:35:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不要再失去你了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.61,0:35:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.11,0:35:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没有呼吸 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.28,0:35:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,活过来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.28,0:35:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.83,0:35:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 活过来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.08,0:35:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让她的气管保持畅通
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.79,0:35:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 查尔斯 查尔斯 - 呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.59,0:35:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止他们 他们在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.05,0:35:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.72,0:35:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着 她还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.18,0:35:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 布兰达 呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.74,0:36:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家让开
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.82,0:36:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.29,0:36:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.79,0:36:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够了 - 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.25,0:36:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最后一次让人死而复生
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.09,0:36:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 别怪罪自己 我知道你只是想帮点忙
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.34,0:36:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好心又体贴的人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.43,0:36:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.18,0:36:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 辛蒂 可我不想要扰乱你的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.31,0:36:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.31,0:36:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是帮大家一个大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.82,0:36:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 那苏怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.11,0:36:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对 对哦 只要接到苏我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.95,0:36:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.29,0:36:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在真的很需要朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.79,0:36:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰达走了 科迪又恨我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.17,0:37:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又遇上了奇怪的…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊好难过（双关语 好硬）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.80,0:37:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛…你这么美 又靠在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.64,0:37:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.06,0:37:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不会跟我这种人约会
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.73,0:37:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果明晚你有空的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.82,0:37:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是答应罗 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.54,0:37:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂 布兰达跟你提过录影带的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.33,0:37:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的确提过
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.33,0:37:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意我上去看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.13,0:37:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪 我马上回来好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.05,0:37:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天走运了 他不知道「你」是男人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.95,0:38:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.53,0:39:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.57,0:39:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 米丽梅
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.54,0:39:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是同性恋 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.75,0:39:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,得…到…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.42,0:39:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.46,0:39:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听…得…到…吗 - 好像可以
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.96,0:39:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听得到吗 - 清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七天 - 七天
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.97,0:39:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我下星期一就会挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.93,0:39:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 不对 等等 星期一吗 那是工作天的算法
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.55,0:40:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说从今天开始算七天 - 现在就开始
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.64,0:40:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的表坏了 我怎么会知道几点开始
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.94,0:40:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管几点了 就是今天 从现在开始七天后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.65,0:40:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是就快放假了 假日也算在内吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.23,0:40:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛…要看情形 是什么节日呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.11,0:40:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马丁路德纪念日 - 那不算
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.32,0:40:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不算 大家都放假啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.57,0:40:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天爷 我给你整整七天了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.99,0:40:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,信不信我现在就过去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.88,0:40:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上取你性命
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要帮你报名另一个比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.92,0:40:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,马哈利 我说过了 我已经不眷恋了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.34,0:40:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾对CJ的姐姐死心
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.80,0:40:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是你瞧 我还是跟她有一腿 - 你还是跟她有一腿
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.39,0:40:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是过得好好的 那是我老姐耶 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.76,0:40:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不相干我不玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.01,0:40:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你以后想怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.89,0:40:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.02,0:40:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 耶 来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.77,0:40:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我哥哥是对的 我应该定下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.07,0:40:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会怎样呢 - 你妈
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.19,0:40:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,又搞到一个了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.28,0:40:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷 乔治老弟 不要一直记得旧事 让它过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不想试试看 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.13,0:41:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得先拿掉盖子 - 你怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.38,0:41:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦对哦 当然罗 - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.55,0:41:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 乔治 可怕的事情发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.59,0:41:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.97,0:41:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 辛蒂 你好吗 怎么了 - 乔治 你得帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.85,0:41:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了那卷录影带 就是杀死布兰达那卷
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.23,0:41:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后电话就响了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.14,0:41:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有声音说我七天后会死
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.77,0:41:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂没有杀人录影带这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.44,0:41:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.86,0:41:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一个人可以帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.90,0:41:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 谁 - 等等 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.40,0:41:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说90街的杰米尔 他上礼拜看了录影带
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.49,0:41:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天早上要醒来时就葛屁了 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.33,0:41:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛屁了怎么醒来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.74,0:41:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说他上床前还好好的呗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.29,0:41:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 谁能帮我忙 - 你来告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.96,0:41:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说有人可以葛屁着上床又好好的醒来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.67,0:41:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛屁了何必上床啊 老兄 那叫脱裤子放屁
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.38,0:41:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 究竟谁能帮我 - 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.63,0:41:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以活着上床
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.88,0:41:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是不在床上葛屁
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.63,0:41:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你已经在床上了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.97,0:41:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才会说「醒来时就葛屁了」
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.55,0:42:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去 真是太深奥了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.64,0:42:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以我说嘛 - 你去开一门课算了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.72,0:42:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你太有才了 - 快说谁能帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.39,0:42:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去 - 真是的夏妮克阿姨可以
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.89,0:42:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟她客兄都搞神秘的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.85,0:42:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最早看到那卷片子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.07,0:42:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚应该去找他们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.36,0:42:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今晚 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.61,0:42:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁要照顾科迪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.36,0:42:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 我们一定会很愉快的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.28,0:42:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有拼图 大富翁…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.45,0:42:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,房间里有棒球卡 还有很酷的模型飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.83,0:42:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去拿过来 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.29,0:42:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮他做了点心
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.79,0:42:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他睡不着 你可以冲牛奶给他
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.75,0:42:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.84,0:42:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会有事的 - 在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.59,0:42:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟孩子处得很好 注意了 科迪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.88,0:42:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有紧急事件…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.72,0:42:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我留下了一些电话 - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.22,0:42:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你还好吧 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.90,0:42:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.81,0:42:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好我走了 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.82,0:43:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 真是的 一个小孩最想要的就是…一个家
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.99,0:43:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.03,0:43:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 科迪很喜欢你 - 他是个乖小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.66,0:43:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.71,0:43:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.39,0:43:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈罗 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.39,0:43:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是辛蒂 我马上过来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.69,0:43:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏妮克阿姨吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.61,0:43:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对啦 不过你可以叫我祭师 不必介意花瓶的事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.32,0:43:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么花瓶 抱歉 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.70,0:43:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个花瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.45,0:43:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.59,0:43:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是椅子的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.22,0:44:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是椅子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.97,0:44:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的来意 你面临了大秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.52,0:44:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你绝不能逃避挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.48,0:44:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.44,0:44:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥菲斯 - 怎么了 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.78,0:44:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.11,0:44:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在看球赛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.45,0:44:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以离开一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.12,0:44:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,湖人队会赢12分
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.42,0:44:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 你可以谈谈… - 录影带是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.13,0:44:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对我看了 然后… - 电话响了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.05,0:44:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对有个声音说… - 你会在七天后死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.68,0:44:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 这让我… - 很困扰
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.18,0:44:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 跟她结婚很恐怖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.93,0:44:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没跟人上床她就发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.94,0:44:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拷贝了一卷带子我们来瞧瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.02,0:44:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.07,0:45:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉我…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.41,0:45:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,录影带和麦田圈有关系吗 有的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.41,0:45:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其中关联要由你来发现
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.66,0:45:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看 这是… - 香烟
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.75,0:45:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说的是灯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.13,0:45:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那座灯塔 那是你的宿命
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.38,0:45:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.56,0:45:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.50,0:45:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.04,0:45:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.63,0:46:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道会发生这事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.80,0:46:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快闪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.88,0:46:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你赶快离开电视机前面
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.76,0:46:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事 让我给你点教训
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.43,0:46:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚出电视机 - 宝贝 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.60,0:46:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让她走吧 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.52,0:46:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 拜托 这样我们又会被告的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.60,0:46:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她吐我口水 我要杀了这三八
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.36,0:46:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了 你赢了 你赢了…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.49,0:46:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打上面… - 对对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.90,0:46:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打下面 - 好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.11,0:46:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了吗 - 宝贝 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.70,0:46:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了她 你疯了吗 - 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.99,0:46:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看你还梳什么 - 冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.33,0:46:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你还梳什么 看你还梳什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.54,0:46:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选错爬出来的电视机了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.71,0:46:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 科迪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.22,0:46:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.76,0:46:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.89,0:47:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在玩一个很好玩的游戏 然后我往下看 然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.35,0:47:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.40,0:47:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.41,0:47:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.62,0:47:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么可以让他看 - 我没有呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.63,0:47:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 是我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.26,0:47:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 - 还好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.80,0:47:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受最后一个星期吗 好想赶快看到你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.59,0:47:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还剩六天对吧 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.51,0:47:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 跟你叙旧很愉快可以跟科迪说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.14,0:47:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 他又没看录影带
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.52,0:47:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 他有 拜托 辛蒂 我是做这一行的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.48,0:47:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过我们
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.49,0:47:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.91,0:47:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是读者文摘 我们对科迪有个优惠方案
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.62,0:48:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你才不是 你是录影带里那个邪恶女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.16,0:48:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 被你拆穿了 那我留个口信给他好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.46,0:48:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.96,0:48:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 怎么写啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.59,0:48:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我会了 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.81,0:48:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你居然让这种事发生 - 我知道 抱歉我搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.81,0:48:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着我们还是能救他的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.90,0:48:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,录影带的答案 还有麦田圈的答案 一切都在灯塔那里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.74,0:48:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会认为我疯了吧 - 我当然这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.74,0:48:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你现在最不需要的就是我这种逊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.95,0:48:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要永远地离开 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.66,0:48:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…我要怎么跟科迪说
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.58,0:48:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他烦心 就说我必须出差
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.55,0:48:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会想出说词的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.59,0:48:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,睾丸癌 这样他就不会乱问
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.01,0:48:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就知道你会谅解的 - 乔治…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.26,0:49:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要小心 你家农场有怪事发生 我知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.35,0:49:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.73,0:49:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候羊儿也需要「发泄」一下
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.98,0:49:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说啥 - 拜拜罗 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.13,0:49:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.39,0:49:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经超过你睡觉的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.56,0:49:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以用你强壮的臂膀摇摇我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.48,0:49:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,被子里还有很多空间
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.19,0:49:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气好热
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.57,0:49:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用穿睡衣的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.49,0:49:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.86,0:50:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了是吗 我就是你女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.20,0:50:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.08,0:50:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.91,0:50:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对苏做了什么 - 我发誓我没碰她
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.71,0:50:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不相信你 - 拜托老天做证 她只是个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.42,0:50:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个变态…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.69,0:50:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹地
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.28,0:50:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗 感觉如何 好玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.92,0:51:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.39,0:51:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么世界
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.14,0:51:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.10,0:51:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东东
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.14,0:51:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.40,0:51:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许辛蒂是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.50,0:51:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托先生 我只需要五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.83,0:51:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 辛蒂 我不想听电视台里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.00,0:51:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些神经又迷信的谣言
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.63,0:51:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 这是个色情电台 也讨论暴力和天气
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.26,0:51:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒提醒了我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.01,0:51:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要AV女优在飓风中死亡的那则新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.01,0:51:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,播个一小时吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.64,0:51:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 查尔斯顿的龙卷风袭击海滩
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.02,0:51:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天有一对裸体情侣
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.69,0:51:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此罹难
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.02,0:51:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生地点距… - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.86,0:51:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一个谋杀案仅差5英里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.36,0:52:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到运动新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.61,0:52:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一卷神秘录影带 看过的人会在七天后死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.53,0:52:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的 我们都有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.04,0:52:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有外星力量在那里 - 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.70,0:52:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是要混淆视听罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.12,0:52:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坎培尔 你疯了吗 - 相信你的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.50,0:52:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡森我必须这么做 - 你听到没
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.71,0:52:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,更正 这件事毫无危险性
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.88,0:52:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我只是随便说说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.05,0:52:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 随便说的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.55,0:52:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个字都不算数 看过的人可能会在一周后死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.23,0:52:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,1-3-4-19…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.23,0:52:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,4-6-9…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.36,0:52:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为这个笨蛋打扫十年了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.40,0:52:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他老婆瞎搞了十二年
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.07,0:52:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我在说啥吗 黑鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.66,0:52:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩骑马打仗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.58,0:52:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢「巧克力」嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.41,0:52:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为总统加油 各位 我是李事端
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.58,0:52:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要和平哦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.71,0:52:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶录影带七天内杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.59,0:53:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星力量威胁地球
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.71,0:53:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟谁是辛蒂.坎培尔
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.55,0:53:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她所言属实 我们就面临空前的危机
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.34,0:53:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打电话给总统 - 你就是总统
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.76,0:53:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那我早就知道这事了 订午餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.43,0:53:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我认为您应该上电视
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.06,0:53:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉大家没有一这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.77,0:53:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在我面前拼字 讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.44,0:53:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人 长官 没有外星人这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.45,0:53:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这句话不太正确 - 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.28,0:53:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年前一架飞碟在新墨西哥州坠毁
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.62,0:53:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能还找到一具尸体 - 可能
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.45,0:53:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛…因为都混在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.37,0:53:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时是感恩节 尸体被送到厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.79,0:53:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从屁屁里塞了馅料 我们就当国宴吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.71,0:53:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我最后一次见到它
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.26,0:53:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 把这记下来 第二天还做了三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.93,0:53:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总统先生 仔细听我说 - 汤普森
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.64,0:53:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,离窗户远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.39,0:53:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我又忘了穿裤子了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.89,0:53:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.79,0:53:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从听到外星人的消息后我就有个感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.65,0:54:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 事情不太对劲 - 我知道你的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.82,0:54:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像事情不太对劲的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.11,0:54:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.32,0:54:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是首老歌 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.49,0:54:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「月亮代表我的心」 这玩意儿真好听
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.00,0:54:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我很感谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.57,0:55:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.08,0:55:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是设计者 你有很多问题
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.75,0:55:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意你很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.26,0:55:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.88,0:55:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦田圈和录影带究竟有何关联
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.68,0:55:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案很简单 你是偶然的必然结果
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.22,0:55:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找寻一个奇特的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.89,0:56:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诡谲 - 怪异 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.77,0:56:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是「权宜的确认」 总有个涵义吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.07,0:56:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我浴室里装针孔
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.28,0:56:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是…这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.70,0:56:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 哎呀 冬天很长的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.08,0:56:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这侵犯了… - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.83,0:56:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是忍不住 这里太寂寞了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.75,0:56:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久没有人跟我作伴了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.92,0:56:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己不算 这椅子也不算
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.22,0:56:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫她琳达
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.09,0:56:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话少说可以吗 我在赶时间
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.30,0:56:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 只要你愿意就可以住下来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.64,0:56:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达可负荷两个人 还可以震动哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.81,0:56:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 我只想知道重点 那个小女孩是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.23,0:56:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.15,0:56:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老婆和我想要个孩子 但她不能生育
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.61,0:56:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不能 - 所以你们领养了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.66,0:56:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱这个女孩 但是她很邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.28,0:57:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她令马匹都疯了 杀了我们的小狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.64,0:57:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把遥控器藏起来 真的很病态
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.16,0:57:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太太把她带到旧家农场 把她丢到井里淹死了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.00,0:57:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为事情就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.30,0:57:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道塔碧莎将邪恶烙印在录影带里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.01,0:57:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是故意让它流出去的 可是… - 可是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不小心放错盒子 还到百视达去了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.35,0:57:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为是「少林足球」呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.52,0:57:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,带子一直流传杀人无数
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.35,0:57:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像「少林足球」一样
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.36,0:57:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那这跟外星人有什么关系 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.19,0:57:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定塔碧莎召唤他们来杀光我们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.15,0:57:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人入侵 我得警告全世界
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.03,0:57:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经开始了 你已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.20,0:57:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.08,0:57:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过让个老头子乐乐可永远不嫌迟
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.04,0:57:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.17,0:57:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 关于空中闪光
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.05,0:57:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,幽浮的行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.47,0:57:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是看到外星人的通报 在全球各地出现
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.51,0:57:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是外星人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.01,0:58:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一批画面进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.56,0:58:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自澳洲雪梨农场令人发指的家庭录影带
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.73,0:58:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请仔细看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.23,0:58:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那里 再看一次
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.19,0:58:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常非常不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是巴西圣保罗传来的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.74,0:58:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再看一次
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.58,0:58:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常非常不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.04,0:58:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,南德州传来的最新画面
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.05,0:58:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有敌意吗 只有一件事可以确定
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.35,0:58:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会被杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.39,0:58:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把房子对起来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.93,0:58:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这有必要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.60,0:58:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种时候还举行颁奖典礼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.85,0:58:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 一切都该如常
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.07,0:58:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,举国上下虽谈不上惊慌失措 但已经严重受到影响
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.94,0:58:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来看看是否可以转移大家的焦点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.61,0:59:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想引起恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.03,0:59:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少有总统需要面对这种危机
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.62,0:59:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道福特会怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.62,0:59:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 闲聊到此结束 到此结束罗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.84,0:59:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢并欢迎大家到白宫来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.59,0:59:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,德蕾莎修女奖表扬
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.63,0:59:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些克服残障
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.72,0:59:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而帮助他人的人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.06,0:59:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论年轻或年老
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.31,0:59:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,白人 黑人或是原住民
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.27,0:59:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 你好吗 你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.15,0:59:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦这是我的光荣
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.57,0:59:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把奖项颁发给大家
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.62,0:59:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个房间是安全的 总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.83,0:59:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许吧 - 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.75,0:59:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在想
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.67,0:59:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果外星人占据人类身体呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.84,1:00:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看起来就像我们一样 几乎一样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.63,1:00:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没这么想过
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.34,1:00:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要保持警觉
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.85,1:00:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们可能出现在任何地方 甚至… - 就在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.81,1:00:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我们从没经压过外星人入侵
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.52,1:00:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好可怕哦 长官 - 别惊慌
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.94,1:00:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们慢慢地朝出口移动
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.61,1:00:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于见到你了 总统先生
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.36,1:00:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生事情了 我就知道 你不可能活捉我的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.28,1:00:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在干搅我的脑
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.83,1:00:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到她了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.21,1:00:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不会得逞的 至少在我面前不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.00,1:00:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.38,1:00:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天老爷啊 小只的有钢牙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.84,1:00:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰瑞的小孩 放屁
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.89,1:00:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 总统先生 你疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.31,1:00:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,像狐狸一样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.77,1:00:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得和知道内情的人谈谈 辛蒂.坎培尔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.06,1:00:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道怎样击退外星人 这些无孔不入的人渣
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.57,1:01:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚令人做呕的东西 滚出我的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.19,1:01:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是有意的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.53,1:01:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总统先生一切都还好吗 - 出口全被堵住了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.20,1:01:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到出口的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.74,1:01:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家让开
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.04,1:01:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这里 长官 天啊 好刺激
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.08,1:01:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很兴奋 你应该摸摸我的乳头
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.34,1:01:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪 科迪
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.59,1:01:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪 你在哪里 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.26,1:01:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过今天在东厢的意外后
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.59,1:01:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,白宫建议大家钉好门窗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.18,1:01:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备迎战外星人入侵
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.39,1:01:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.98,1:01:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请看第八频道的独家报道
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.60,1:01:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的杀人录影带
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.94,1:01:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我们独家取得
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.57,1:01:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚为您播映 好刺激哦 再重播一次
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.70,1:01:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 没有人进得来了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.45,1:01:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 乔治 不过我们得到地窖去了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.04,1:01:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔治 - 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.96,1:01:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 下去地窖
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.75,1:02:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 科迪 老天 - 辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.21,1:02:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我担心死你了 - 他大约一小时前出现
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.51,1:02:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我试着打电话的 - 不 他没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.38,1:02:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧我本来要打的 - 不 他没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.43,1:02:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪重点是你不该那样跑走
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.98,1:02:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟乔治在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.64,1:02:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我知道你想要个父亲 不过…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.65,1:02:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我科迪 我什么都不在行 怎么能做个父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.07,1:02:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治叔叔
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.00,1:02:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的 科迪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.33,1:02:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会死对不对
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.92,1:02:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪 我跟你说过 你母亲在你出生时说的话吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.80,1:02:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.09,1:02:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直陪着她 她痛了很久
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.22,1:02:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你漏出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.98,1:02:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈痛苦地大叫
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.31,1:03:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫着说 把我杀了吧 用便盆把我打死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.81,1:03:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么做 别让我再痛了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.69,1:03:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在血渍中不停破口大骂
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.99,1:03:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍了下来 想看的话改天你可以看
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.70,1:03:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于你生下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.78,1:03:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈自己把脐带剪断
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.62,1:03:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 还试了两次
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.33,1:03:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次把你的小鸡鸡剪成两段
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.33,1:03:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟她喝醉了 其实是嗑了药
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.50,1:03:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们前一天晚上出去欢度圣派翠克节
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.21,1:03:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想 「我没试过安非他命」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.72,1:03:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她吸了点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.72,1:03:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的小鸡鸡 - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.10,1:03:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们缝反了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.47,1:03:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以我尿尿都朝上 - 对 以后再来想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.89,1:03:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这件事记下来了 就记在「装第四台」下面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.81,1:03:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之你生出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.69,1:03:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈转向我说 「你想要这家伙吗？带走吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.57,1:03:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她就死了 于是我带走了你 你知道为什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.91,1:03:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一场大火里失去了猫咪 我需要有东西摸摸喂喂的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.00,1:04:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念那只猫 科迪
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.58,1:04:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我爱你 没有什么可以改变这一点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.42,1:04:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是我们即将要面对的死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.09,1:04:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.06,1:04:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们走了吗 - 都没有声音了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.23,1:04:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别担心 苏 没事的 - 是乔治叔叔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.28,1:04:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉呀好可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.78,1:04:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 苏
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.28,1:04:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是什么笨东西让灯熄了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.75,1:04:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些多余的保险丝
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.04,1:04:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以拿过来 就可以让灯亮起来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.09,1:04:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 乔治 拿那个铁轨木条
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.63,1:04:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来堵住门
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.47,1:04:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的蛋蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.22,1:04:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这些啦 天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.31,1:05:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.60,1:05:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治叔叔我很害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.06,1:05:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 过来这里 没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.61,1:05:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,门的另一头有东西耶
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.12,1:05:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.85,1:05:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.10,1:05:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看得到吗 它们在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.52,1:05:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们好可怕 它们灰灰的 有着大大的黑眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.52,1:05:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的牙齿好丑
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.53,1:05:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们好像在笑 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.11,1:05:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.49,1:06:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 我想…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.45,1:06:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像要…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.04,1:06:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命 - 科迪
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.71,1:06:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 尽情挥棒 乔治
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.88,1:06:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来了 科迪 我会救你的 - 辛蒂 救我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.01,1:06:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.72,1:06:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 该死的外星人 放了他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.39,1:06:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们进不来的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.31,1:06:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还有什么 - 乔治
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.56,1:06:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,使出来啊 受够了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.23,1:06:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 科迪 以后再谢我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.98,1:06:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,科迪 谢谢上帝 来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.07,1:06:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爹地 爹地 - 苏
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.58,1:06:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,马哈利 你在这里做啥
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.91,1:06:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我永远罩你的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.87,1:06:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢主 门那里有两个
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.08,1:06:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 它们走了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.50,1:06:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他们进不来的 我听到它们不能开门
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.21,1:06:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们可以在太空中飞行 却不能穿过一扇木门
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.76,1:07:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,地窖是最安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.01,1:07:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 所有女人和小孩都在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.60,1:07:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 男人我们出去迎战
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.27,1:07:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 几岁以下才算小孩
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.85,1:07:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.00,1:07:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.05,1:07:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我以为我踩了刹车
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.97,1:07:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就不必透过保险公司了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.06,1:07:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 你在这里做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.27,1:07:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找辛蒂坎培尔
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.64,1:07:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能知道击退外星人的方法
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.40,1:07:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶 空军来了 开着新型圆式飞机呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.61,1:08:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有圆式飞机 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.41,1:08:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天爷
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.62,1:08:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.76,1:08:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唷 什么事呀 乔治 - CJ
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.63,1:08:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了我会永远罩你的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.68,1:08:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还把兄弟都找来了 大家下车吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.01,1:08:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唷 要射谁来着 - 准备好开战了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.52,1:08:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 大家上吧 因为我现在很骇
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.93,1:08:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的很骇 - 你踩到我了 三八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.19,1:08:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再叫我三八 我就把卡车停到你屁眼里
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.19,1:08:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静下来嘛 - 可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.23,1:08:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像在家似的 - 它们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.65,1:08:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.78,1:08:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和男士们会解决的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.70,1:08:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我们开始吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.86,1:08:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你 我会马上轰掉这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.45,1:08:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你娘可好吗 - 我有你家电话
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.28,1:08:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过来罗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.37,1:08:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会轰掉任何东西 我的蛋蛋比他还大 听到没
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.87,1:08:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的那个很短吧黑仔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.83,1:08:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃子弹吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.67,1:09:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信看到什么
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.72,1:09:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人为国捐躯 送花给他们的老婆和马子吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.19,1:09:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法脱身
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.36,1:09:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们一定有弱点的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.58,1:09:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.91,1:09:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要没有了头 它们就失去了力量
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.92,1:09:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 不要 我们没有恶意
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.08,1:09:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到这里来找寻一名邪恶的女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.17,1:09:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在七天内摧毁她
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.38,1:09:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也看了录影带
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.88,1:09:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为那是「少林足球」就在卫星上播出了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.39,1:09:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一星期前的事了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.10,1:09:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们整个星球都会灭亡了除非杀了那女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.48,1:09:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看吧 它们很平和的 - 如果它们爱好和平
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.27,1:10:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那刚才干嘛想让我们窒息
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.52,1:10:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们打招呼的方式
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.24,1:10:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗 很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.07,1:10:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈罗 - 哈罗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.70,1:10:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们怎么说再见
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.20,1:10:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得问一声啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.62,1:10:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们觉得奇怪 那你应该看我们怎么撒尿
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.88,1:10:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们差别并不大
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.68,1:10:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里怪怪的 好像我以前来过似的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.27,1:10:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.65,1:10:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是旧家农庄 她就死在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.08,1:11:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下面有东西
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.03,1:11:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,推回去 跟我做
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.03,1:11:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟着做 - 对 你会了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.45,1:11:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这一幕 人类和外星人同心协力
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.70,1:11:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都属于银河一族
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.46,1:11:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族…那是我尽力逃避的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.38,1:11:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.51,1:11:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.89,1:12:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太太带她到旧家农壮 把她丢到井里淹死
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.36,1:12:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小女孩很怕这口井
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.80,1:12:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.96,1:13:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该回到井底了 三八
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.05,1:13:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 辛蒂 - 不要 不要伤害他
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.60,1:13:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂 快出来 外星人没有敌意
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.48,1:13:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 科迪 我会救你的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.85,1:13:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.07,1:13:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必使坏的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.57,1:13:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.62,1:13:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你妈妈做的事 那是不对的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.24,1:13:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是个小女孩 你还是那个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.33,1:13:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过像个僵尸 牙齿丑了些
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.59,1:13:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你需要一个母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.43,1:13:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.02,1:14:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以组成… - 一个家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.87,1:14:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.83,1:14:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的爱破解了诅咒解放了我的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.37,1:14:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我再也不杀人了 - 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.92,1:14:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 只是唬唬你们罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.05,1:14:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想祝你们好运 大家都靠你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.85,1:14:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.86,1:14:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没关系的 它是我们的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.86,1:14:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你拯救我们的族人 我们必须回去了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.70,1:14:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.07,1:15:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.76,1:15:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜了 乔治
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.05,1:15:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远会罩你的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.18,1:15:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊 请进
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.40,1:15:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.46,1:15:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 我好高兴 我们终于是一家人了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.46,1:15:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你和我…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.71,1:15:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可恶 - 可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.22,1:16:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛蒂 乔治 等一下
